        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LKE625SBR, Slim 5/8\" Diameter Wood Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis slim 5/8 inch diameter Baird wooden door pull is available in 5 inch, 7 inch, and 9 inch lengths, making it ideal for light-weight doors or as a cabinet pull. This little door pull is available in a wide selection of different woods--all of them unfinished for a natural look that is beautifully offset by the solid brass brackets. Some choices include mahogany and cherry. Recently, white oak has been very popular for this type of handle, and we think that the pale wood is beautiful against almost any color bracket. Speaking of the brackets, they are available in over 10 different finishes, so you can find something that matches your existing decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Baird Wood Cabinet Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BRD01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions LKE625SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LKE625005SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE625007SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LKE625009SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "5/8 Inch Diameter Baird Wooden Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "This slim 5/8 inch diameter Baird wooden door pull is available in 5 inch, 7 inch, and 9 inch lengths, making it ideal for light-weight doors or as a cabinet pull. This little door pull is available in a wide selection of different woods--all of them unfinished for a natural look that is beautifully offset by the solid brass brackets. Some choices include mahogany and cherry. Recently, white oak has been very popular for this type of handle, and we think that the pale wood is beautiful against almost any color bracket. Speaking of the brackets, they are available in over 10 different finishes, so you can find something that matches your existing decor. \r\n",
                "keywords": "Slim Baird Wood Pulls, 5/8 Inch Diameter Baird Wooden Pulls, First Impressions BRD01, FII-BRD01, cabinet door pulls, cabinet handles, Slim 5/8 Diameter Wood Door Handles, First Impressions Baird Wood Door Handle, First Impressions Baird collection series 1 door pulls, Wood Cabinet Handles, Wood Cabinet pulls, FII-LKE625SBR, First Impressions LKE625SBR, First Impressions lake 625,"
